  "content": "\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"width:1142px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/wordmarks/outlined/cracked/f32_wordmark.png\" alt=\"Faithful 32x\"> <br><br>\n<h1 style=\"font-weight:900\"><br>Minecraft 首选的 32x 资源包。</h1>\n<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft-bedrock/addons/faithful-32x-bedrock\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"width:1142px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/bedrock_button.png\" alt=\"在此获取基岩版资源包\"> </a></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<hr>\n<p>Faithful 32x 独树一帜，采用现代且细致的艺术风格。它侧重于重新构思纹理而非简单重绘，充分利用了更高分辨率的优势。其显著特点包括精简的色彩搭配与对画面一致性的坚持。<br><br>多年来，该资源包经历了巨大的演变。自 2010 年由 Vattic 最初发起以来，它已成为一种文化标志，并深受数百万 Minecraft 玩家的喜爱。准备好成为其中一员了吗？</p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><br><a href=\"https://discord.gg/sN9YRQbBv7\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"width:1142px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/discord_button.png\" alt=\"Discord 服务器\"> </a> <br><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffaithfulpack.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"width:1142px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/website_button.png\" alt=\"官网\"></a></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">其他信息：</h1>\n<p>如果您有任何反馈、想要报告错误或需要一般性帮助，请加入上方的 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/sN9YRQbBv7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a> 服务器，提交 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Faithful-32x-Java/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub Issue</a>，或在下方留言。如有任何商业或分发相关问题，请参阅我们的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffaithfulpack.net%252flicense\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">许可协议</a>。<br><br>所有纹理和附加组件均由贡献者在业余时间志愿提供。任何人都可以通过上方链接的 Discord 服务器提交纹理，或制作 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffaithfulpack.net%252faddons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">附加组件</a> 以在我们的官网上正式列出。在开始之前，请务必阅读我们的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdocs.faithfulpack.net%252fpages%252ftextures%252ff32-texturing-guidelines\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">纹理绘制指南</a>，其中详细规定了该资源包的艺术风格。<br><br>每个资源包均在我们<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffaithfulpack.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">官网</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/faithful_resource_pack/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252ffaithful_resource_pack%252fsubmissions%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Planet Minecraft</a> 和 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFaithful-Resource-Pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a> 上发布，部分资源包还额外列于 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmcpedl.com%252fuser%252ffaithful-resource-pack%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MCPEDL</a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.minecraftforum.net/members/Faithful_Resource_Pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 论坛</a>。<strong>从其他任何网站下载均为非官方、不受支持且可能存在风险！</strong> 请注意网络安全。</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">我们的其他项目：</h1>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/faithful-64x\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"width:1142px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/f64_button.png\" alt=\"Faithful 64x\"> </a> <br><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/classic-faithful-32x-pa\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"width:1142px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/cf32_button.png\" alt=\"经典 Faithful 32x\"> </a> <br><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/classic-faithful-32x-jappa\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"width:1142px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/cf32j_button.png\" alt=\"经典 Faithful 32x Jappa\"> </a> <br><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/classic-faithful-64x\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"width:1142px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/cf64j_button.png\" alt=\"经典 Faithful 64x Jappa\"> </a></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<hr>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:smaller\">Faithful 是一系列开源且由社区驱动的 Minecraft 资源包合集，旨在提供比原版更高清晰度的纹理，同时忠实还原原作风格。</div>",
